1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:07,960
You've probably felt super motivated one Sunday night, and you tell yourself you're going to wake up early on Monday, do your skincare routine, eat healthy, and be productive.
你可能也曾在周日晚上动力满满，告诉自己周一要早起、护肤、健康饮食，还要高效做事。

2
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,320
Then Monday comes along.
然后，周一到了。

3
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:12,190
You might make it through the entire day doing all your habits.
你也许能坚持一整天，把计划里的习惯都做完。

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,799
But then Tuesday hits.
但接着，周二来了。

5
00:00:13,799 --> 00:00:14,830
You overslept.
你睡过头了。

6
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:21,069
Work was extremely stressful, and so you just abandon everything, telling yourself you'll just start fresh next Monday.
工作压力很大，于是你把计划都放弃了，告诉自己下周一再重新开始。

7
00:00:21,079 --> 00:00:22,749
This was literally the story of my life.
这简直就是我以前生活的写照。

8
00:00:22,759 --> 00:00:26,280
But here's the thing, it's not your fault that other routines haven't worked.
但关键是，其他日常计划没起作用，并不一定是你的错。

9
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:31,880
The reason you keep finding yourself in the same draining cycle is not because you lack willpower or discipline.
你反复陷入这种消耗精力的循环，原因并不是你缺乏意志力或自律。

10
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:34,670
It's because you've been trying to change everything at once.
而是因为，你一直试图一下子改变所有事情。
